content.text:
Here is what was wrong, what we changed, and where things stand.

## Root cause

Shell E2Es were not failing on “setup” or Playwright alone. The renderer was hitting the `ErrorBoundary` with:

`ReferenceError: Cannot access 'applyRailSizePreset' before initialization`

The global keyboard `useEffect` listed `applyRailSizePreset` in its dependency array **before** `const applyRailSizePreset = React.useCallback(...)` runs later in the same `App` function. That is a real temporal-dead-zone bug in source order, not a flaky test.

## Fix (production)

A ref is created early, the hotkey path calls through it, `applyRailSizePreset` is removed from that effect’s deps, and the ref is updated right after the callback is defined:

```474:477:c:\Users\KickA\Documents\GitHub\NeuralShell\src\renderer\src\App.jsx
    const streamAbortRef = React.useRef(false);
    /** Keyboard effect runs before `applyRailSizePreset` is declared — use a ref to avoid TDZ. */
    const applyRailSizePresetRef = React.useRef(null);
```

```2351:2360:c:\Users\KickA\Documents\GitHub\NeuralShell\src\renderer\src\App.jsx
                const pid = map[e.code];
                if (pid) {
                    const applyPreset = applyRailSizePresetRef.current;
                    if (typeof applyPreset === 'function') applyPreset(pid);
                }
                return;
            }
```

```4253:4256:c:\Users\KickA\Documents\GitHub\NeuralShell\src\renderer\src\App.jsx
        }).catch(() => {});
    }, []);
    applyRailSizePresetRef.current = applyRailSizePreset;
```

## E2E bootstrap (still valuable)

`e2e/e2eShellBootstrap.cjs` plus wiring in `react-core`, `ui-controls-sweep`, and `operatorHomeCanvas` still helps first-run / `localStorage` timing: init script + synchronous `evaluate` seed, `goto` same URL instead of bare `reload` where it matters, setup wizard fallbacks, `NODE_ENV` override so Electron never loads the Vite URL when `NODE_ENV=development`, and `operatorHomeCanvas` `beforeAll` uses `testInfo.setTimeout`.

## Verification

- `npm run build:renderer` — OK  
- `npm run verify:ui:shell` — **37 passed** (~2.6m)  
- `npm run lint` — OK (repo `eslint` scope)

`verify:ui` (full matrix) was not run here; say if you want that long run next.

## Release todo

**Tag v2.1.32 + installer (n6)** is still pending on your side when you are ready to ship.

